Little sister-in-law's the one who looks out for big brother.

16
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:47,600
Little sister-in-law?

17
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,680
Hey.

18
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:55,240
Wait for me a moment, Miss Shen.

19
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,360
Wait for me.

20
00:02:58,440 --> 00:02:59,400
Come on, little sister-in-law.

21
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,440
Let's you and me drink.

22
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,640
- One more round.
- One more round.

23
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,280
Right now?

24
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,160
Is that alright…

25
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,200
Okay.

26
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,680
Okay.

27
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:17,760
