87
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:54,040
aren't they just animals?

88
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,160
I'm not an animal.

89
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,280
I'm a person.

90
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,360
I'm not an animal.

91
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,680
Screw you.

92
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:31,320
So it's a honey trap?

93
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,200
Playing me?

94
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:34,880
You dare play me?

95
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,680
Playing me?

96
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:43,160
Shen Mo!

97
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,080
Are you okay?

98
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,080
It's an anesthetic.

99
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:50,280
We can't let him get away.

100
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,000
Screw you.

101
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:55,160
The phone…

102
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:52,880
(Imperial Video Screening Room)

103
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:35,040
I'm sorry.

104
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:37,240
I'm truly sorry.

105
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:40,600
If I've offended you two in any way—

106
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:42,080
I apologize.

107
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:44,480
You think an apology can fix what you've done?

108
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:48,480
This whole thing really is a misunderstanding.

109
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:53,760
I've always had the greatest respect for Miss Shen.

110
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,920
It was Yin Hong who kept lying to me.

111
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,840
She told me you were willing.

112
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,520
Here's what we'll do.

113
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,800
You let me go—

114
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:05,040
